    "causal_summary": "On 2026-10-21 a manual cleanup found 22 orphaned processes holding about 315 MB: `node --test` runs from removed worktrees, a Pi worker and its child, a harness Python server, test helpers, a `git-live-follow` for a scratch repository, `tail -F` and `grep` monitors, and eight `grep -r` searches stuck on `/private/tmp`",
